<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Global Daily News</title>
</head>
<body>

    <header style="text-align: center;">
        <h1>Global Daily News</h1>
        <p>Your Trusted Source for Latest Updates</p>
    </header>

    <hr>

    <nav style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="#world">World</a> |
        <a href="#sports">Sports</a> |
        <a href="#entertainment">Entertainment</a> |
        <a href="#podcast">Podcast</a> |
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <hr>

    <section id="world">
        <h2>World News</h2>
        <p>Today's top headline: Global leaders meet to discuss climate change initiatives.</p>

        <img
            src="https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/1200x675/p09xtmrp.jpg"
            alt="BBC World News"
            width="400"
        >

        <p>
            <a href="https://www.bbc.com/news" target="_blank">
                Read more on BBC
            </a>
        </p>
    </section>

    <hr>

    <section id="sports">
        <h2>Sports Update</h2>
        <p>Highlights of yesterday's football match with thrilling last-minute goals!</p>

        <iframe
            width="560"
            height="315"
            src="https://www.youtube.com-nocookie.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ"
            frameborder="0"
            allowfullscreen>
        </iframe>
    </section>

    <hr>

    <section id="entertainment">
        <h2>Entertainment Buzz</h2>
        <p>New movie trailer released today. Fans are excited!</p>

        <video width="400" height="225" controls>
            <source src="movie.mp4" type="video/mp4">
            Your browser does not support the video tag.
        </video>
    </section>

    <hr>

